The compatibility implementation in src/scrapling/markdown.rs is derived from
markdownify 1.2.3 and reproduces the observable tree behavior of Beautiful
Soup 4.15.0's html.parser builder.

Frozen source hashes:

- markdownify/__init__.py: 281bca0e2ab84a21825376f82d07d95455f41a6b0392bf95950bf29aac540b40
- bs4/__init__.py: 90e007f82a9fc5bcf22a8df3b395b7bc5245e54d65cd68fd51ca12a414718d4e

